# Feature modules (`apps/<app>/src`)

Applies to every Next.js app under `apps/`.

- `app/` — routes only. Pages import from `@/features/<name>`.
- `features/<name>/` — one domain. Repeat `components/`, `hooks/`, `lib/`, `server/queries/`, `server/actions/` as needed.
- `shared/` — this app only; never import a feature.
- Cross-app or real libraries go in `packages/`.

`features/a` must not import `features/b`. Compose in `app/`, or hoist to `shared/` / `packages/`.

Inside a feature, use relative imports. Do not import `@/features/...` from another feature.
